   "lines": [
    "Paddled with Emlen",
    "down to our old",
    "camping ground at",
    "the foot of the",
    "Lake and back",
    "— about 25 miles.",
    "Hunted ^for^ partridges,",
    "but found none.",
    "Picked up a duck",
    "in the thoroughfare.",
    "Em & Arthur are",
    "capital fellows for",
    "a trip of this",
    "kind — unselfish,",
    "good natured, and",
    "not minding a",
    "little fatigue &",
    "hardship."
   ],
